        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wright Brothers' Mysteries</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Book 1 - Tourist Trap</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fun interactive multipath full motion visual novel</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This popular XBOX 360 console game has NOW been ported to Steam for PC!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We follow two crime-solving brothers ( Cade and Evan Wright ) who investigate a robbery at Granny Franny's house, where the thief inadvertently leaves behind a clue that provides a key lead, and You have to help them solve the mystery from there while going to various locations and gathering clues. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay primarily consists of watching full-motion video cutscenes, with interactive elements in between, players make choices at certain points, which alter the storyline.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interactive Visual Novel</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multipath Options</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full Motion Video</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cool Retro Low Poly Style</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choices Matter</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different Endings</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Main Menu</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In-Game Menu</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SAVE</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >LOAD</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* NOTE: The game was built with &quot;The Movies&quot; Game Engine by Lionhead Studios and the Videos are used as per their license agreement. *</p>",
